---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | ABOH LEGAL"
  description="Terms of Use for abohlegal.ca. Important information about using this website, legal disclaimers, and solicitor-client relationship notice."
>
  <Hero label="Legal" title="Terms of Use" />

  <section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10">

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">By using this website, you agree to these terms.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">2. Information Only</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">The content on this website is general information. It is not legal advice. Every situation is different, so speak with a lawyer about your own facts.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">3. No Solicitor-Client Relationship</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">Using this website, sending a message, or booking a consultation does not make you our client. We act for you only after we confirm in writing that we will. Until then, please do not send us confidential details about your case.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">4. Accuracy of Information</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">We try to keep this website accurate and up to date, but we do not promise that it is complete or current. The law changes, and some content may not reflect the latest developments.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">The text, logos, and design of this website belong to ABOH LEGAL and are protected by Canadian copyright law. Do not copy or use them without our written permission.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">6. External Links</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">This website links to other websites. We are not responsible for their content or their privacy practices.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">ABOH LEGAL is not liable for any loss or damage from using, or being unable to use, this website or its content.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">8. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">These terms are governed by the laws of the Province of Alberta and the federal laws of Canada applicable therein.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">9. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">We may change these terms at any time. If you keep using the website, you accept the changed terms.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">10. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">Questions about these terms can go to <a href="mailto:info@abohlegal.ca" class="text-gold hover:underline">info@abohlegal.ca</a> or <a href="tel:+18254610107" class="text-gold hover:underline">(825) 461-0107</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
